# API Client Functions

This folder will contain typed API client functions that interact with the backend REST API.

## Structure
- `products.ts` - Product-related API calls
- `cart.ts` - Cart management API calls
- `orders.ts` - Order management API calls
- `auth.ts` - Authentication API calls
- `users.ts` - User profile API calls

## Usage
```typescript
import { getProducts, getProduct } from '@/lib/api/products'
```